  (text "ESP32-C3 Super Mini carrier for the BC-250 (serial_led_controller)."
    (at 20.32 20.32 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "6c73cfdc-933c-439e-b3da-14a18db006c3")
  )
  (text "The Super Mini brings its own USB-C, 3.3 V regulator, BOOT/RESET buttons and GPIO8 LED."
    (at 20.32 24.13 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "3d2e2430-8124-448d-b6eb-1f293309b76e")
  )
  (text "U1 is not soldered: it plugs, pins down, into the 1x8 sockets J12 (left column) and J13 (right), USB-C at the board edge."
    (at 20.32 46.99 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "3030bcc6-46ed-42f4-86e8-3570c2fc3b26")
  )
  (text "Its USB VBUS is tied to the 5V pin: cut the red wire in the USB cable (README, Power switch)."
    (at 20.32 27.94 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "e2f9ebd9-503a-42e9-a80a-d4089b1058f1")
  )
  (text "The switch common (J9 pin 4) is a real GND: power_switch.pins.button_gnd is null in the config."
    (at 20.32 31.75 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "2e98f209-778f-4365-ac97-a5062dccb581")
  )
  (text "Fan header pin 1 = GND, 2 = +12 V, 3 = tach (unused), 4 = PWM. FAN1..4 = GPIO 5, 6, 7, 10 = fans.header1..4."
    (at 20.32 35.56 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "be97b5c7-9a6b-452e-b418-3dd271e5d979")
  )
  (text "J1 takes the FSP500-30AS 10-pin Mini-Fit Jr plug; pin map per its pinout drawing (see README)."
    (at 20.32 39.37 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "d8d2e86a-0968-49cf-8618-e251b0d56c01")
  )
  (text "VIN is the strip supply rail (3.3 V from the PSU), separate from 5VSB; the strip path is sized for 3 A."
    (at 20.32 43.18 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "4ba8694c-b187-4085-85dd-d5c7ff072e64")
  )
  (text "Mounting holes, M3:"
    (at 20.32 163.83 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "083905fc-8348-46bb-a31a-a11f043ddb0f")
  )
